[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles HVPS Interface Application FW Software Requirements Specification
UID: DHF-HRC-0019
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: hvps-interface/main

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to provide Software Requirements Specifications for the Heracles
HVPS Interface Application Firmware (FW).
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes all requirements of the Heracles HVPS Interface Application FW. The
information in this document has been derived from the VoxelRay Heracles Product Requirements
Specification.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware systems.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
  Firmware

HVPS
  High Voltage Power Supply

LED
  Light Emitting Diode

MCU
  Microcontroller Unit

PID
  Proportional Integral Derivative controller

PRS
  Product Requirements Specification

SDP
  Software Development Plan

SRS
  Software Requirements Specification

SW
  Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The HVPS interface application firmware is used to control and receive feedback from HVPS.

The HVPS interface application firmware reports data back to and receives commands from the main
control application firmware. The HVPS interface application firmware contains routines to ramp up
the filament current, as well as the high voltage. It contains a PID loop for regulating the
emission output to a given setpoint.

The HVPS interface application firmware runs on the MCU of the HVPS interface board.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: References

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Heracles SDP: DHF-HRC-0001 Rev. 2

Heracles SVP: DHF-HRC-0003 Rev. 2

Heracles FW Architecture Description: DHF-HRC-0031 Rev. 1

Heracles HVPS Interface Application FW SDD: DHF-HRC-0096 Rev. 1
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
PREFIX: RQ-H1FWHVPS-
TITLE: Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-1
TYPE: Safety
TITLE: Grid control clock
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to generate an output for a grid control clock at a frequency between 1
kHz and 20 kHz
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-2
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Runtime counter
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to maintain a runtime counter which updates every 1 ms
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-4
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Main control reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall periodically report values to the main control board at a rate greater than 1 Hz
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-5
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: HVPS digital status signals
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to read and report digital I/O status signals from the HVPS
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-6
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Filament current setpoint
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to accept a command from the main control board to set a target filament
current setpoint
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-7
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Dynamic grid setpoint
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to accept a command from the main control board to set a target dynamic
grid setpoint
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-8
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: High voltage setpoint
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to accept a command from the main control board to set a target high
voltage setpoint
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-9
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Cathode current limiter setpoint
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to accept a command from the main control board to set a cathode current
limiter
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-10
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Cathode current feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to read and report the feedback signal for the cathode current
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-11
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: High voltage feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to read and report the feedback signal for the high voltage
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-12
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Adjustment grid voltage feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to read and report the feedback signal for the adjustment grid voltage
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-13
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Filament current feedback
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to read and report the feedback signal for the filament current
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-14
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Control loop
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall implement a control loop in order to automatically adjust output parameters
during x-ray emission in order to help stabilize emission output
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWHVPS-17
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Filament current ramp up
STATEMENT: >>>
The firmware shall be able to ramp up the filament current at a rate not greater than 250mA every
second
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
